      "headline": "Moving Money Into Egypt — and Out Again: A Foreign Buyer's Guide",
      "description": "How foreign buyers transfer funds into Egypt, why the route matters for residency, what devaluation means for a hard-currency earner, and what to know about getting proceeds out.",
